P3para.Text:
in subsection (1), after the words
“section 11” there shall be inserted the words “
“or 11A ”;

in subsections (2) and (4), after the words
“section 11” there shall be inserted the words “
“or subsection (4) of section 11A ”;

for the words
“for or to another” there shall be substituted the words “
“for use at work or an article of fairground equipment and does so for or to another ”;
